{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game directly brings together restaurant management and suspense. While you prepare and deliver customer orders on time, you also have to deal with different threats that hunt you. Restoring power quickly during outages, checking the cameras before stepping outside, remembering to look behind you, and neutralizing the sniper that targets you if you go too far; all are part of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kitchen side is clear and practical: buy products, check and stock what comes out of boxes, set up fridge and shelf organization, cook, and deliver the right menu to the customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/ae10d9d6d091a5925edb07c6b22446dc.poster.avif?t=1761753508\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/ae10d9d6d091a5925edb07c6b22446dc.webm?t=1761753508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orders and delivery:</strong> Prepare the menu customers want and take it to the correct table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shopping and stocking:</strong> Procure boxes; check their contents and place items in fridges and on shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooking system:</strong> Prepare ingredients in the correct order, cook, and serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/b264a4b67a8ac778eccf5967cc69c2c3.poster.avif?t=1761753508\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/b264a4b67a8ac778eccf5967cc69c2c3.webm?t=1761753508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/b264a4b67a8ac778eccf5967cc69c2c3.mp4?t=1761753508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of threats</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hunter who enters the restaurant to search for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A presence that appears behind you and kills you if you don\u2019t look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power outage: If you don\u2019t restore it, you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera check: If you go outside without checking, you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniper: If you go too far you become a target; if you don\u2019t neutralize him in time, you die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera monitoring: If you go outside without checking cameras, you die. Before stepping out, monitor security cameras and time your move correctly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and money management: Manage your time and money well. Earn enough cash, buy a sniper rifle to eliminate the enemy on the roof, and reach the ending by 24:00.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/55154036a30fa2bd4cdf92f6afbfce05.poster.avif?t=1761753508\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/extras/55154036a30fa2bd4cdf92f6afbfce05.webm?t=1761753508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Perfect Menu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/75bd394b3ade73181431c3d4bb98a8da569c4521.jpg"},{"name":"Clean Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/a3faf51bb24834956545a4a6e6788066ec5ef84c.jpg"},{"name":"Power\u2019s Back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/63ac4f5b06f7a4d8e55b5c99b87235d0208647ed.jpg"},{"name":"One Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/5673cd966361ae22d177df19f065c71cfc6433c0.jpg"},{"name":"Lose the Tail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/b3e24d0808169a95fd9ef89abe0e3591c1f9e80e.jpg"},{"name":"Hide in the Closet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/f7d0533804d36e48349077d8c23e9c0ed219c410.jpg"},{"name":"Don\u2019t Move","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/ed8b79af4e1418fd0bb20ab085af1aa522ce23a1.jpg"},{"name":"Smoke Alarm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3807760/3ca4ab936a478b709467da06cdfabcf8b2091065.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807760?t=1761753508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/a581fedcb58f8f91852aad4a3bb0be8fa4920b7c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761753508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/25962ca8138d2fd340edd9e1fdd76545d94a6f98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761753508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807760/25962ca8138d2fd340edd9e1fdd76545d94a6f98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761753508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo